6720</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Radbruch</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Voltz</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Was ist speziell an der spezialisierten Palliativversorgung?</article-title><source>Z Palliativmed</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>1</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1055/s-2008-1082353</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>